Z||000008||2birds||01-20-2001||11:07 PM||||1. Red over silver 86-7 GT's (naturally, since I own one) <BR>2. Black 88 GT with black wheels  <BR>3. Red Formula.  They look like an early MR2 on steroids, which is not a bad thing, IMHO. I wouldn't mind having one.<BR> <BR>My true favorite would be one they never sold, that being the red GT based convertible with the Centerline wheels in Gary Witzenburg's Fiero book.||||reg||1
